    "username": "emollick",
    "nickname": "Ethan Mollick",
    "text": "It seems like SpaceX/Grok and Meta/Muse have started to keep pace in the near-frontier category while also introducing a new category of cheap, fast &amp; closed  specialized coding models.\n\nBoth were tied with the Big Three at some point, fell behind, but may have started to return.",
